Borderline is a 2025 American comedy thriller film written and
directed by Jimmy Warden in his directorial debut.

13
01:11:52,941 --> 01:11:58,941
Starring Samara Weaving, Ray Nicholson, Jimmie Fails, Alba Baptista, and Eric Dane, the film centers on a pop star (Weaving) whose home is invaded
by an obsessive fan (Nicholson) who believes they are meant to get married and manipulates her into going along with his delusion.

14
